n in raw materials, coupled with the tariffs, it is driving price increases and I think, what we're seeing is that suppliers are all trying to fill their way through what exactly is going to happen when, how much can we take out in…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/01/wayfair-inc-w-q3-2018-earnings-conference-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"W 2018 Q3","e":"w","d":"2018-11-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Niraj Shah","x":"…bit to what happened with Brexit where you had a -- in that case, there was no notice period, the tariffs have a notice period, but there you had the pound, the FX and currency change dramatically, and the suppliers are generally buying products denominated in dollars, or material denominated in…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/01/wayfair-inc-w-q3-2018-earnings-conference-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"W 2018 Q3","e":"w","d":"2018-11-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Niraj Shah","x":"And so, what we've been hearing from suppliers is that, it does create a period of discontinuity where they're all going back in their supply chain seeing what cost, they can take out because obviously, they would love to not raise prices.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/01/wayfair-inc-w-q3-2018-earnings-conference-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"W 2018 Q3","e":"w","d":"2018-11-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Niraj Shah","x":"And in terms of price increases, I think the reality is that the amount of inflation in raw materials, coupled with the tariffs, it is driving price increases and I think, what we're seeing is that suppliers are all trying to fill their way through what exactly is going to happen when, how much…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/01/wayfair-inc-w-q3-2018-earnings-conference-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"W 2018 Q4","e":"w","d":"2019-02-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Niraj Shah","x":"That 80% I've said that's coming in container direct is much more efficient from a logistics cost standpoint, and that is very attractive to the supplier, their ability to pass through a lower wholesale and obviously, therefore, have a lower retail.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/22/wayfair-w-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"W 2018 Q4","e":"w","d":"2019-02-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Niraj Shah","x":"So suppliers can just, through the extranet, launch items into the clearance area by passing through a discount to help manage their overstocked inventory.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/22/wayfair-w-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"W 2019 Q1","e":"w","d":"2019-05-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Niraj S. Shah","x":"One is just scale buying power, second is logistics efficiencies as we grow with the infrastructure we're building and the third is as we build up the house brands with the higher-quality merchandising and the pricing power we get there.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/02/wayfair-inc-w-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"W 2019 Q1","e":"w","d":"2019-05-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Niraj S. Shah","x":"…of the quality of visual imagery, the portion of the catalog that has 3D models, what we're able to do with full environmental imagery as we get more models, the latest navigation on the site lets you really explore rooms and styles, that is what we have found unlocks a lot of the pricing power.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/02/wayfair-inc-w-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"W 2019 Q2","e":"w","d":"2019-08-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Niraj Shah","x":"Here we also have some volatility that's imposed on us, frankly in the sense of tariffs, our business model is more resilient than that of a traditional retailer by being a platform.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/01/wayfair-inc-w-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"W 2019 Q2","e":"w","d":"2019-08-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Michael Fleisher","x":"As we take supplier tariff price increases and put them into customer prices, right, that's going to change the purchase timeline and process for our customer.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/01/wayfair-inc-w-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"W 2019 Q3","e":"w","d":"2019-10-31","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Niraj Shah","x":"In the short term, tariffs are injecting greater-than-expected volatility into our marketplace, as customer consideration cycles are disrupted and larger than normal amounts of substitution occur in response to price changes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/wayfair-inc-w-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"W 2019 Q3","e":"w","d":"2019-10-31","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Michael Fleisher","x":"Before we discuss the details of our third quarter financial performance and expectations for the end of the fiscal year, I want to take a step back and provide a bit more context on how our business is managing through the latest tariff-related volatility.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/wayfair-inc-w-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"W 2019 Q3","e":"w","d":"2019-10-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Niraj Shah","x":"So the price increases that came through last year were really minor or nonexistent.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/wayfair-inc-w-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"W 2019 Q3","e":"w","d":"2019-10-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Niraj Shah","x":"And so basically what's happened is there's no clean date when people started passing through price increases and what you find it's actually focused at all kinds of different things.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/wayfair-inc-w-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"W 2019 Q4","e":"w","d":"2020-02-28","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Niraj Shah","x":"For the first time in many years, consumers experienced price inflation for furniture decor and most other home good items as the reality of onerous tariffs began to filter through the supply chain.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/28/wayfair-inc-w-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"W 2019 Q4","e":"w","d":"2020-02-28","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Niraj Shah","x":"Our suppliers, who absorbed much of the initial wave of tariffs in 2018, could not sustain doing so again in 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/28/wayfair-inc-w-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"W 2019 Q4","e":"w","d":"2020-02-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Niraj Shah","x":"To course correct then, we took an initiative to streamline our processes and tightening our measurement even as our objectives remain the same.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/28/wayfair-inc-w-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"W 2019 Q4","e":"w","d":"2020-02-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael Fleisher","x":"But the full economic benefits of the recent reduction in force will not fully show up until Q2.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/28/wayfair-inc-w-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"W 2020 Q1","e":"w","d":"2020-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael Fleisher","x":"Our selling, operations, technology and G&A or opex expenses came in at $412 million, excluding severance costs related to the February reduction in force.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/05/wayfair-inc-w-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"W 2020 Q1","e":"w","d":"2020-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael Fleisher","x":"Reflecting in large part the reduction in force we undertook as part of the plans put in place late last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/05/wayfair-inc-w-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"W 2021 Q2","e":"w","d":"2021-08-05","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"David Leonard Bellinger","x":"If I recall correctly, I believe shoppers were taking a bit longer to convert after some of the tariffs went through a few years back.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/05/wayfair-inc-w-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"W 2021 Q2","e":"w","d":"2021-08-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Niraj S. Shah","x":"We're working with our suppliers to pass through some of these higher costs while paying close attention to our customers' reactions to higher prices across all of our classes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/05/wayfair-inc-w-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"W 2021 Q2","e":"w","d":"2021-08-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael D. Fleisher","x":"Higher AOVs represent two factors this period: cost inflation being passed through and higher-than-typical mix toward the outdoor category, which tends to have higher priced items or sets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/05/wayfair-inc-w-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"W 2021 Q3","e":"w","d":"2021-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael D. Fleisher","x":"As anticipated, gross margins have come down sequentially as volume levels have begun to normalize and as we remain thoughtful about which inflationary elements to pass through versus absorb in the shorter term.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/06/wayfair-inc-w-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"W 2021 Q3","e":"w","d":"2021-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Peter Keith","x":"So based on our supplier conversations and some of our own analysis, it looks like there has been a decision to raise prices even to a point where you're a little bit above the competition.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/06/wayfair-inc-w-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"W 2024 Q4","e":"w","d":"2025-02-20","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Niraj S. Shah","x":"So on the first question around price investments and tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/20/wayfair-w-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"W 2024 Q4","e":"w","d":"2025-02-20","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Niraj S. Shah","x":"So on tariffs, let's just take a step back and I just want to provide a little bit of background for those maybe who haven't followed us for five, six years now.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/20/wayfair-w-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"W 2024 Q4","e":"w","d":"2025-02-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Eric Sheridan","x":"In terms of the part of the letter where you talked about advertising, both from a stimulant of growth and then the rate of pace of cost reduction.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/20/wayfair-w-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"W 2026 Q1","e":"w","d":"2026-04-30","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Niraj Shah","x":"As we have scaled our brand awareness to household name status in both Canada and the U.K., we're evolving our marketing mix to mirror our U.S. strategy, moving beyond traditional channels to aggressively lean into platforms like TikTok, Connected TV and streaming audio.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/wayfair-w-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"W 2026 Q1","e":"w","d":"2026-04-30","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Niraj Shah","x":"We're not just experimenting with AI, we're actively using it to widen our competitive moat.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/0